## Parser notes for AERONET text output

```
# AERONET v3 file anatomy (first 7 lines = metadata, skip in rows parser):
# Line 1: "AERONET Version 3 AOD Level 1.5"
# Line 2: "Investigator: ..."  
# Line 3: "Site: All_Sites"
# Line 4: blank
# Lines 5-6: processing info
# Line 7: column header row  ← this is the field name row
# Lines 8+: data             ← these are the data rows
#
# Column names contain special chars like [440nm] and (Degrees) —
# your field_in parser must handle brackets/parens in key names,
# or normalize them at ingest (replace with underscores).
#
# Date format: DD:MM:YYYY  Time: HH:MM:SS
# Combine as ISO: {day}:{month}:{year} {HH}:{MM}:{SS} → map to t field
```

